     A**********************************************************
     A* IVPRPCLAD
     A* Re-run Repricing Price Ladder
     A**********************************************************
     A* The rungs a laddered price may land on, in ascending order
     A* within a catalogue group. Used when a matched rule carries
     A* RULROUND LADR: the suggestion is the first rung at or above
     A* the rule percentage, which is how the Choral octavo bands
     A* are defined ("ladder step >= +6%") instead of a percentage
     A* band. Seeded with the published Choral rungs 2.10 - 5.99.
     A**********************************************************
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R IV$RPCLAD                 TEXT('Repricing price ladder')
     A            LADCATG        5A         TEXT('Catalogue group')
     A                                      COLHDG('CAT' 'GROUP')
     A            LADSEQ         3S 0       TEXT('Rung order ascending')
     A                                      COLHDG('SEQ')
     A            LADPRICE       9S 2       TEXT('Rung price')
     A                                      COLHDG('RUNG' 'PRICE')
     A            LADMNTTS        Z         TEXT('Last maintained timestamp')
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'TS')
     A            LADMNTWHO     10A         TEXT('Last maintained by')
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'WHO')
     A          K LADCATG
     A          K LADSEQ
